# <type>(<scope>): <short imperative summary>
#
# Why: why this change is needed
# How: how the change was implemented
# Validation: commands/checks run and their results
#
# For feat/fix commits, add a unique footer:
# Change-Id: WB-YYYYMMDD-NNN
#
# Allowed types: feat, fix, docs, refactor, test, chore, build, ci, perf, revert
